---
/* The dock: search above live chat, two round icon buttons fixed to the
   bottom-right corner of every page (Nahian, 2026-09-23). It replaces
   the labelled search bar that sat at the bottom centre, where the
   prototype's page-switcher pill had been.

   It carries its own ground rather than following the nav's light/dark
   state: the nav knows what is behind the TOP of the frame, and this sits
   at the bottom, where the answer is different. A dark frosted disc with
   a light hairline reads on the street, on the night sections and on
   paper alike, which is the only treatment that survives all three.

   The client's sheet lists a search button (Sheet1, B2); neither what it
   opens nor the chat is designed yet, so these are the controls only.
   With no visible label, each carries its name as aria-label. */
---

<div class="dock">
  <button class="dock__btn" type="button" aria-label="Search" data-search>
    <svg class="dock__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
      <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"></circle>
      <path
        d="m16.6 16.6 4 4"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="2"
        stroke-linecap="round"
      ></path>
    </svg>
  </button>
  <button class="dock__btn" type="button" aria-label="Live chat" data-chat>
    <svg class="dock__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
      <path
        d="M4 11.5C4 7.4 7.6 4 12 4s8 3.4 8 7.5S16.4 19 12 19c-1.1 0-2.2-.2-3.1-.6L4.5 20l1.2-3.6A7.2 7.2 0 0 1 4 11.5Z"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="2"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
      ></path>
      <circle cx="8.5" cy="11.5" r="1.1" fill="currentColor"></circle>
      <circle cx="12" cy="11.5" r="1.1" fill="currentColor"></circle>
      <circle cx="15.5" cy="11.5" r="1.1" fill="currentColor"></circle>
    </svg>
  </button>
</div>

<style>
  /* The corner is square: the same --search-gap from the bottom and the
     right, each clear of the handset's safe area. */
  .dock {
    position: fixed;
    right: calc(var(--search-gap) + env(safe-area-inset-right, 0px));
    bottom: calc(var(--search-gap) + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px));
    /* Above the pinned sections and the drawer's backdrop alike. */
    z-index: calc(var(--z-modal) + 1);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--search-stack-gap);
  }

  /* 44px discs — a real tap target on a phone. */
  .dock__btn {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: var(--search-h);
    height: var(--search-h);
    padding: 0;
    border-radius: var(--r-full);

    border: 1px solid var(--glass-line);
    background: var(--glass);
    backdrop-filter: blur(14px) saturate(1.3);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px) saturate(1.3);
    box-shadow: var(--e-3);

    color: var(--glass-ink);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition:
      background var(--t-fast) var(--ease-io),
      border-color var(--t-fast) var(--ease-io);
  }

  .dock__btn:hover {
    background: var(--glass-lift);
    border-color: var(--glass-line-lift);
  }

  .dock__btn:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--pink);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .dock__icon {
    width: 1.25rem;
    height: 1.25rem;
    opacity: 0.86;
  }
</style>
